"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[28,22,77,87,86,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[28,22,77,87,86,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[28,22,77,87,86,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[28,22,77,87,86,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[28,22,77,87,86,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"名门王堂后裔，益州本土士林领袖。刘璋麾下治中从事、学者、代理蜀郡太守。刘焉病逝，王商与赵韪联名上表朝廷，推举刘璋继任益州牧。多次劝阻刘璋疏远反复无常的马超，指出接纳马超将养虎为患。为人善学且见多识广，故与刘表等名士皆多往来，多次建议刘璋应多多招揽人才。名士许靖入蜀，盛赞：若王商生于中原，即便是名士王朗也比不上他，身价冠绝巴蜀士林。王商治蜀十年，兴修水利、劝课农桑。建安十六年，卒于任上，许靖接任蜀郡太守。","tc":"名門王堂后裔，益州本土士林領袖。劉璋麾下治中從事、學者、代理蜀郡太守。劉焉病逝，王商與趙韙聯名上表朝廷，推舉劉璋繼任益州牧。多次勸阻劉璋疏遠反復無常的馬超，指出接納馬超將養虎為患。為人善學且見多識廣，故與劉表等名士皆多往來，多次建議劉璋應多多招攬人才。名士許靖入蜀，盛贊：若王商生于中原，即便是名士王朗也比不上他，身價冠絕巴蜀士林。王商治蜀十年，興修水利、勸課農桑。建安十六年，卒于任上，許靖接任蜀郡太守。","en":"A descendant of the prestigious Wang Tang and a leader of the local literati in Yi Province. Under Liu Zhang, he served as Secretary of Promotions, scholar, and acting Governor of Shu Commandery. Upon Liu Yan's death from illness, Wang Shang and Zhao Wei jointly submitted a memorial to the imperial court recommending Liu Zhang succeed as Governor of Yi Province. He repeatedly advised Liu Zhang to distance himself from the fickle Ma Chao, warning that harboring him would be rearing a tiger to one's own peril. Dedicated to learning and broadly knowledgeable, he maintained close ties with notable figures such as Liu Biao, and repeatedly urged Liu Zhang to recruit talented individuals. When the renowned scholar Xu Jing entered Shu, he praised him lavishly: ‘Had Wang Shang been born in Zhongyuan, even the famed Wang Lang could not compare to him,’ considering his standing peerless among the scholars of Bashu. Wang Shang governed Shu for ten years, constructing water conservancy works and encouraging agriculture. In the 16th year of Jianan, he died in office, and Xu Jing succeeded him as Governor of Shu Commandery.","jp":"名門・王堂の末裔であり、益州の在地士林を代表する領袖。劉璋配下の治中従事、学者、蜀郡太守代行を務めた。劉焉が病没すると、王商は趙韙と連名で朝廷に上表し、劉璋を後継の益州牧に推挙した。変節常態な馬超を遠ざけるよう幾度も劉璋を諫め、馬超を受け入れることは虎を養いて患いを残すようなものだと指摘した。学を好み見識も広かったことから、劉表ら名士とも盛んに交流し、劉璋に対しても人材を広く招聘するよう度々進言した。名士の許靖が蜀に入ると、「もし王商が中原に生まれていれば、名士の王朗といえども彼には及ばないだろう」と絶賛され、その名望は巴蜀の士林において冠絶していた。王商は十年にわたり蜀を治め、水利を興し、農桑を奨励した。建安十六年に在任のまま没し、許靖が蜀郡太守を引き継いだ。","kr":"명문 왕당의 후손이자 익주 토착 사림의 영수이다. 유장 휘하에서 치중종사를 지낸 학자이자 촉군태수 대리였다. 유언이 병사하자 왕상은 조위와 함께 조정에 연명으로 표를 올려 유장을 후임 익주목으로 추대했다. 유장에게 변덕스러운 마초를 멀리하라 누차 간언하며, 마초를 받아들이는 것은 호랑이를 길러 화근을 남기는 격이라고 지적했다. 배움을 즐기고 식견이 넓어 유표를 비롯한 여러 명사들과 폭넓게 교류했으며, 유장에게 인재를 적극 초빙해야 한다고 거듭 진언했다. 명사 허정이 촉에 들어와 '만약 왕상이 중원에서 태어났다면 명사 왕랑조차 그에게 미치지 못했을 것'이라 극찬했을 만큼 파촉 사림에서 최고의 명망을 떨쳤다. 왕상은 10년 동안 촉을 다스리며 수리 시설을 정비하고 농경과 양잠을 장려했다. 건안 16년, 재임 중에 세상을 떠났으며 허정이 그 뒤를 이어 촉군태수를 맡았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10501","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"商","nameTc":"商","nameEn":"Shang","nameJp":"商","nameKr":"상","nameOther":"","word":"文表","wordTc":"文表","wordEn":"Wenbiao","wordJp":"文表","wordKr":"문표","wordOther":"","icon":"王商","power":"WJ10045","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1038","gender":"0","rule":"28","force":"22","wise":"77","politics":"87","charm":"86","will":"78","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/6/6/71/25/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1004302","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003705","warSoulPoint":"300","battleSoulPoint":"400","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"1007315","strategy2":"1002105","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/4/2/2/0/3/4/0/3/2/0/1/3/1/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"36","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"7000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"151","show":"188","death":"211","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026405","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;9/1;11/1;15/1;21/1;39/1;27/0;31/0;42/0;12/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10058/6;WJ10743/6;WJ10326/6;WJ10015/4;WJ1028015/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIP